    "about-founder": {
      "type": "club-founder-note",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/WhatsApp_Image_2025-12-13_at_4.12.37_PM.jpg",
        "eyebrow": "A Note From Fred",
        "body": "<p>I started FredJo because I wanted clothes that didn't ask for permission — pieces that carry a point of view without saying a word.</p><p>Born in Paris, shaped by global street culture, FredJo is for people who already know who they are. No trends to chase. No apologies to make.</p><p>Refined in Paris. Worn everywhere.</p>",
